---
import Simple from '../layouts/Simple.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site.js';
---
<Simple title="Accessibility Statement | Final Touch Fencing" h1="Accessibility statement" label="Accessibility" path="/accessibility/" description="Final Touch Fencing’s commitment to an accessible website, and how to reach us if something doesn’t work for you.">
  <p>We want everyone to be able to use this website. It’s designed to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2, Level AA. It uses semantic headings and landmarks, labeled form fields with text error messages, visible keyboard focus, sufficient color contrast and descriptive image text, and it respects reduced-motion settings.</p>
  <h2>Need help?</h2>
  <p>If any part of this site doesn’t work for you, call us at <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a> or email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. We’ll take your quote request by phone and work to fix the problem.</p>
</Simple>
